        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, 2020</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, 2020
The electricity used to run the pump storage power plant is modelled by a specific electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Switzerland in 2018.; UUID:323be085-bd1d-365a-9acb-c6665d52d315
Included are the energy and material consumption of the pumped storage power plant.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_323be085-bd1d-365a-9acb-c6665d52d315.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
